  partId: usb_cip
  title: "USB-Seri \xC7ip"
  description: "USB ile ana i\u015Flemci aras\u0131nda terc\xFCman: bilgisayar\u0131n
    USB sinyallerini seri haberle\u015Fmeye \xE7evirir. Orijinal kartta ATmega16U2,
    \xE7o\u011Fu klon kartta CH340G \xE7ipi bulunur."
  funFact: "Klon kartlar i\xE7in bilgisayara CH340 s\xFCr\xFCc\xFCs\xFC kurmak gerekebilir;
    orijinal kart s\xFCr\xFCc\xFCs\xFCz tan\u0131n\u0131r."
  color: {r: 0.65, g: 0.5, b: 1, a: 1}
  primary: 0
  explodeOffset: {x: -0.010801, y: 0.048, z: 0.0028455}
  labelPoint: {x: -0.03086, y: 0.0024, z: 0.00813}
  labelDirection: {x: -0.53911966, y: 0.8301671, z: 0.14202991}
